     "titulo": "Asking for a change politely",
     "texto": [
      "**Θα ήταν δυνατόν να…;** («would it be possible to…?») softens a request. To introduce a condition, use **αν** + present: **αν υπάρχει δυνατότητα** («if there is a possibility»).",
      "First practice with the example; then try to express the same idea with your own information."
     ],
